00:16:38,050 --> 00:16:40,270
causes visual interference for you

418
00:16:40,270 --> 00:16:42,950
Therefore, you can use the REBASE approach

419
00:16:42,950 --> 00:16:46,110
directly move the root of your big red branch

420
00:16:46,110 --> 00:16:48,860
move it to the latest main branch

421
00:16:48,860 --> 00:16:52,360
This way you can avoid these other branches from others

422
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:54,960
a visual distraction in your current view

423
00:16:54,960 --> 00:16:58,740
and reduces the need to scroll through your entire branch history

424
00:16:58,740 --> 00:17:01,950
the mouse wheel keeps scrolling down

425
00:17:01,950 --> 00:17:04,470
A lot of things improve reading efficiency

426
00:17:04,470 --> 00:17:07,619
You occasionally use the REBASE method to keep up with the main branch

427
00:17:07,619 --> 00:17:10,579
will significantly reduce your scrolling distance when reviewing

428
00:17:10,579 --> 00:17:13,199
This not only reduces the scrolling distance for viewing

