00:20:34,810 --> 00:20:36,410
can be simplified into a straight chain

514
00:20:36,410 --> 00:20:37,490
when resolving conflicts

515
00:20:37,490 --> 00:20:40,990
handle it when grafting yourself onto the top of the other

